(7393411, 1162127, 38032, '<td valign="top">A heavy-hearted image in a challenge not predictably so. Thank you. I can hope that is nice natural light through a window. I''m imagining a person not likely to enjoy the outdoors for a while. The monochrome makes this timeless and painful. The POV is just right.The textures and human touch begins a story we we all hear some day. A rare 10 from me.</td>', 'A heavy-hearted image in a challenge not predictably so. Thank you. I can hope that is nice natural light through a window. I''m imagining a person not likely to enjoy the outdoors for a while. The monochrome makes this timeless and painful. The POV is just right.The textures and human touch begins a story we we all hear some day. A rare 10 from me.', '2015-07-29 09:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
