(7395101, 1162591, 163081, '<td valign="top">Yeah, the blue :)<br/>Can you imagine that only finding that typical picnic blanket took me a half day. Drew the setup on paper first, then bought all the food. really clean and fresh fruit. Then find a location with a sunset. Jomari, I can assure you that I got maybe 50 mosquito bites, there were ants all over the place, and flies. (there is one on the grapes)Many joggers stopped to see the setup and really appreciated my "professional style" . It was really really fun to do this. I wanted to get my daughter''s rabbit on the picture, but I was alone that day.</td>', 'Yeah, the blue :)Can you imagine that only finding that typical picnic blanket took me a half day. Drew the setup on paper first, then bought all the food. really clean and fresh fruit. Then find a location with a sunset. Jomari, I can assure you that I got maybe 50 mosquito bites, there were ants all over the place, and flies. (there is one on the grapes)Many joggers stopped to see the setup and really appreciated my "professional style" . It was really really fun to do this. I wanted to get my daughter''s rabbit on the picture, but I was alone that day.', '2015-08-05 01:28:15.000000', NULL, 0),
